00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:28,000
 level. So, let me just go back. Okay, now let me just say I want to give it admin access. So,

40
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:32,880
 I will just click on this admin access. And then I will just click next. And then I can just click

41
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:38,320
 on create user. So, you can see it has created the user successfully. So, I can just click on

